  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_quernstone_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>stones for a quern, viz. a simple apparatus for grinding corn, usually consisting of two circular stones, the upper of which is turned by hand (OED s.v. quernstone, quern1) | stone for a quern, viz. a simple apparatus for grinding corn, usually consisting of two circular stones, the upper of which is turned by hand (OED s.v. quernstone, quern1) | stones for a small quern, viz. a simple apparatus for grinding grain, usually consisting of two circular stones, the upper of which is turned by hand (OED s.v. quernstone, quern1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
